{
  "tema": 5972,
  "slug": "ser-caracteristicas-esenciales",
  "titulo": "Ser for essential characteristics",
  "subtitulo": "«Beto es alto y la playa es bonita.»",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Use ser (not estar) for what someone or something is like by nature: looks, personality, size, shape, material. Estar is for temporary states.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ser** describes what someone or something **is like**: looks, personality, size, material."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "ser",
            "+",
            "adjective / noun / de + material"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Estar** + adjective describes a **state** or a change: **estoy cansado**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With a noun after it, it's always **ser**: **Tijuana es una ciudad grande**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Beto ==es== alto.",
              "en": "Beto is tall."
            },
            {
              "es": "La playa de Rosarito ==es== muy bonita.",
              "en": "Rosarito beach is very pretty."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi mamá ==es== muy paciente.",
              "en": "My mom is very patient."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tijuana ==es== una ciudad grande.",
              "en": "Tijuana is a big city."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis vecinos ==son== simpáticos.",
              "en": "My neighbors are nice."
            },
            {
              "es": "La mesa ==es== de madera.",
              "en": "The table is made of wood."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Beto está un hombre alto."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Beto es un hombre alto."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "With a noun: always **ser**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "La casa está de madera."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "La casa es de madera."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Material: **ser de**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Careful: a few adjectives change meaning. **Ana es aburrida** = Ana is _boring_ (her nature); **Ana está aburrida** = Ana is _bored_ (right now). Both are right."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parientes",
      "titulo": "Related rules",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "soy, eres, es",
              "texto": "First, the verb: [[5070|ser in the present]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "estoy feliz",
              "texto": "For feelings, estar: [[5980|estar for feelings and emotions]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "soy de Tijuana",
              "texto": "Origin also takes ser: [[6806|ser for origin]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kwiz",
      "titulo": "Check yourself",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Say it out loud, then open the answer."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "mini_kwiz",
          "lista": [
            {
              "p": "In Spanish (his nature): _My brother is tall._",
              "r": "Mi hermano es alto.",
              "nota": "A trait: ser."
            },
            {
              "p": "In Spanish: _Tijuana is a big city._",
              "r": "Tijuana es una ciudad grande.",
              "nota": "Noun after: ser."
            },
            {
